  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cameroon ABW Citizenship and Political participation project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Governance systems and processes are more inclusive, accessible, and responsive to the rights, requirements and aspirations of people with disabilities, in all their diversity, so that the furthest behind (especially women and girls, people with intellectual disabilities and youth with disabilities) meaningfully engage in decision-making and governance structures in Cameroon.</narrative>
  </description>
